  "data": {
    "document": "Chapter Approved",
    "section": "Mission Sequence",
    "summary": "Play on a 44\" by 60\" battlefield. Use a suggested Chapter Approved layout (see the official Warhammer 40,000 app), or build your own:\n\n1. Roll a D6. A 1–5 keeps the one centre **objective** point shown on the Deployment card; a 6 replaces it with two points, 6\" to each side of it along the dashed line between the players' territories.\n2. Players alternate placing **terrain features** after a roll-off, the winner going first.\n3. Cover each objective point with one terrain feature; that feature becomes a **terrain objective**.\n4. Place the remaining terrain features last.",
